{
  "r0": "gid://shopify/OnlineStoreThemeJsonTemplate/page.about?theme_id=166186909939",
  "t0": [
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.about.json.main.eyebrow:1756y41fnznes",
      "value": "Nuestra historia",
      "translatableContentDigest": "9247cb620a1c322140959500a5ed4d0dd6a65b433344565a10a354c53f1a2500"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.about.json.main.story.title:2v0vd871hbgr1",
      "value": "El atelier",
      "translatableContentDigest": "ec4183c77136dcc2fd93ef4234e7713d435e8ba813bff6edbf4e09d3ddf97abe"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.about.json.main.story.text:2ssvge2t6jwk0",
      "value": "<p>Cuenta cómo nació la casa, quién hace el trabajo y con qué materiales. Dos o tres párrafos suelen bastar.</p>",
      "translatableContentDigest": "afab74bf3c498a67bb7910f9c8d36d454e5151505ae4b286d35b3ff17257db62"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.about.json.main.quote.quote:1jp9y6wwwi1ji",
      "value": "Una prenda está terminada cuando ya no se le puede quitar nada más.",
      "translatableContentDigest": "846e946a5e4ff657047f8a36455529ac6f66adba98927de65e03301c05b1aa71"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.about.json.main.quote.attribution:kn0q9ig4tvt1",
      "value": "Dirección del atelier",
      "translatableContentDigest": "0884004ff930df8947c6ce1667098c706055c4736e270c6d98d9a8f6cf3c1daf"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.about.json.main.quote.role:1gngb88cqdo80",
      "value": "Corte y acabado",
      "translatableContentDigest": "b424a0d98776374344c5b327aa41c8f58527ed7b04798732063d4137a676a0ae"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.about.json.main.values.title:1rw6tc4av4q6u",
      "value": "Lo que defendemos",
      "translatableContentDigest": "c70637c14c3b31e5b2918642a62103ae2ac561e34de27416dd1dba55fa02613f"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.about.json.main.values.value_1_title:23l4ycqug0b0s",
      "value": "Fibras trazables",
      "translatableContentDigest": "e1ef3225c15dbbbb36cf406d798648586b1607989aa639da98b23610da4850bb"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.about.json.main.values.value_1_text:3hgaao8630nld",
      "value": "<p>Cada tejido se compra a una tejeduría que podemos nombrar.</p>",
      "translatableContentDigest": "9b1bc3eeabed7e0def8ad0f1e7496c4931642e4068e52e104712540a59aedc92"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.about.json.main.values.value_2_title:23l4zrah26hov",
      "value": "Acabado a mano",
      "translatableContentDigest": "60d421494ba65e8fa00a8f8fda4aa4120b12a561b2893b2eb53da41e8911005d"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.about.json.main.values.value_2_text:3hgaaprb4s7gy",
      "value": "<p>Cantos, forros y ojales se trabajan a mano.</p>",
      "translatableContentDigest": "60878a3678aa145e1520909f4691891cc65281bc01d8db6dd198a9a468730212"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.about.json.main.values.value_3_title:23l4xcsco33ny",
      "value": "Series cortas",
      "translatableContentDigest": "6eff1ca4316ffc918167af6c1b17d4bcaf0749a867c2ddbd5531234e922d9e7b"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.about.json.main.values.value_3_text:3hgaan4xwptwz",
      "value": "<p>Las piezas se cortan en tiradas cortas y rara vez se repiten.</p>",
      "translatableContentDigest": "d8cf6983ce85925656a734536c4c524cef28bc68d0921a4b17410d4fb3b6bfc1"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.about.json.main.gallery.title:oo9h6ri29c3q",
      "value": "Dentro del estudio",
      "translatableContentDigest": "302bec82fa3c5f653d08b6eee5b0aa1a1620edd39df4eb63164c2974cc5f21ff"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.about.json.main.gallery.caption:2td9moz8ohzoo",
      "value": "Corte, prueba y acabado, fotografiados a lo largo de una temporada.",
      "translatableContentDigest": "ce228352afcbdfde63feac4183e93c67211435b29cb68895a41b4a649e5ec438"
    }
  ],
  "r1": "gid://shopify/OnlineStoreThemeJsonTemplate/page.contact?theme_id=166186909939",
  "t1": [
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.contact.json.main.eyebrow:37mlaij7953u1",
      "value": "Contacto / Atención a clientes privados",
      "translatableContentDigest": "8b2e63a3078de09dd14333bfcd8f38fcb982e2434ddd64ce80e7ff0cd42aa917"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.contact.json.main.intro:31vt97u25b43a",
      "value": "<p>Escribe al estudio sobre un pedido, un material o una cita privada.</p>",
      "translatableContentDigest": "b55c4043c4b2b80baa231e0b6d6e9f3d0ac2154550aaa00c2b8379d16f5aece0"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.contact.json.main.studio_hours:3ix0y4bvlqjac",
      "value": "De lunes a viernes / 10:00–18:00 CET",
      "translatableContentDigest": "df7175d3320a3be48356af9e991d1df480f0c5cf4b83a3aaef23b28525a0dde9"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.contact.json.main.showroom_address:1yrebxtdkv7jh",
      "value": "Con cita previa / Milán",
      "translatableContentDigest": "8094fe2c1ac7ccaf0df8a0cdb575e3e8ac678c78890e905c54307fea2c6f6d76"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.contact.json.main.faq_shipping.question:pwuq63udixfa",
      "value": "Envío y procedencia",
      "translatableContentDigest": "df6a54a4997be35a6e4649acfce132d2a3369207d8039f1459b63011ec4c71dd"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.contact.json.main.faq_shipping.answer:lwh35piaqxno",
      "value": "<p>Las piezas disponibles salen del atelier en un plazo de tres días hábiles. Los trabajos por encargo incluyen una estimación de envío.</p>",
      "translatableContentDigest": "44dd69396cf3cdddb526845ff13b7be7c4903b9208b90881a73365e725b0502d"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.contact.json.main.faq_care.question:2erkv56ixp5d",
      "value": "Cuidado y durabilidad",
      "translatableContentDigest": "7d64a6e04055af378295da6b31c29a95a3ac0e5a945af6b2b8ab173c0e78a446"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.contact.json.main.faq_care.answer:2i37oioalk8qr",
      "value": "<p>Cada edición incluye sus instrucciones de cuidado. Escribe al atelier para reparaciones y recomendaciones según el material.</p>",
      "translatableContentDigest": "b55e8e4ac137ea2c473bef192dfcee14b631195245f6d40af8fef5ce5fb0206c"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.contact.json.main.faq_returns.question:exaecv1in9h9",
      "value": "Devoluciones y cambios",
      "translatableContentDigest": "d3acc26da39823ed97e781d29a06da8473459d2187786e24b8ae0aaf28089a03"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.contact.json.main.faq_returns.answer:20zfjdyoitt2n",
      "value": "<p>Escribe a nuestro servicio de atención con tu número de pedido para iniciar una devolución o un cambio.</p>",
      "translatableContentDigest": "dc290d16579c1bce2950de3a1399181f3720d7853d87bb0563fec26da1cde8f5"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.contact.json.main.faq_bespoke.question:kr29pk589wrl",
      "value": "Citas privadas",
      "translatableContentDigest": "1ef3dd73909750cf411c2f26d87f31fd219747047dda3c01ae80f897c43154d8"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
      "key": "section.page.contact.json.main.faq_bespoke.answer:ci3b31j3dypf",
      "value": "<p>Ofrecemos citas en el showroom y a distancia, previa solicitud.</p>",
      "translatableContentDigest": "9857b9c0d4ab890a239dfcca96ce869cb315488778f81e66486a95b09bfed4a8"
    },
    {
      "locale": "es",
